I was dreaming, the dream of those days

557
00:51:32,167 --> 00:51:37,867
臆病だった どこにも行けなかった
I was cowardly, I couldn't go anywhere

558
00:51:37,867 --> 00:51:43,667
変わりたくて 電車に乗り込んだ
Wanting to change, I boarded the train

559
00:51:43,667 --> 00:51:46,467
この世界で一枚だけの切符
The only ticket in this world

560
00:51:49,667 --> 00:51:51,967
路線図も時刻表も
Even the route map and timetable

561
00:51:51,967 --> 00:51:54,667
今は空白だけど
Are blank now, but

562
00:51:54,667 --> 00:51:59,167
窓の向こうには 青より青い水平線
Beyond the window is a horizon bluer than blue

563
00:52:01,167 --> 00:52:07,167
海想列車 ほんの少しだけ 怖いけれど 走り出した夢はもう止まらない
Kaishou Ressha, just a little scary, but the dream I started running won't stop

564
00:52:07,167 --> 00:52:13,467
正解なんて考えてみてもわからないから 目の前広がるこの景色を見ていたい
I don't know the correct answer even if I think about it, so I want to see this scenery

565
00:52:30,867 --> 00:52:36,167
夢を見ていた あの頃の夢を
I was dreaming, the dream of those days

566
